@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   物件設計
' chapter:      6-1
' realizes:     UC-04, FR-13
' source:       frontend/focus-flow/src/pages/StudentCourses.jsx, backend/src/routes/conversation.routes.js, backend/src/services/conversation.service.js, backend/src/services/askLimits.service.js（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依 Conversation／Message API、共用限額與 retry 路徑重繪
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title Web對話建立與續用循序圖

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "學生" as Student
participant "StudentCourses" as CoursePage
participant "apiFetch()" as ApiClient
participant "ConversationController" as ConversationController
participant "ConversationService" as ConversationService
participant "CourseAccessService" as AccessService
participant "AskLimitsService" as AskLimits
database "Conversation model" as ConversationModel
database "Message model" as MessageModel
participant "QaService" as QaService

Student -> CoursePage : 在授權課程輸入問題
opt 尚無可續用的 conversationId
  CoursePage -> ApiClient : POST /api/v1/conversations { courseId }
  ApiClient -> ConversationController : createConversation()
  ConversationController -> ConversationService : createConversation({ user, courseId })
  ConversationService -> AccessService : assertCanAccessCourse(user, course)
  AccessService --> ConversationService : active Enrollment + published Course
  ConversationService -> ConversationModel : create(userId, courseId, default title)
  ConversationModel --> ConversationService : Conversation
  ConversationService --> CoursePage : 201 { conversationId }
end

CoursePage -> ApiClient : POST /api/v1/conversations/{id}/messages { content }
ApiClient -> ConversationController : sendMessage()
ConversationController -> ConversationService : sendMessage({ user, conversationId, content })
ConversationService -> ConversationModel : findById() 並驗證 owner
ConversationService -> AccessService : assertCanAccessCourse()
ConversationService -> AskLimits : assertCanAsk(user, question)

alt 超過字數或學生每日次數
  AskLimits --> ConversationService : 400 QUESTION_TOO_LONG／429 QA_DAILY_LIMIT_EXCEEDED
  ConversationService --> CoursePage : 拒絕且不建立 Message
else 允許提問
  ConversationService -> MessageModel : 讀取最近有效訊息
  ConversationService -> MessageModel : create(role=user, status=completed)
  ConversationService -> ConversationService : contextualizeQuestion(history, content)
  ConversationService -> QaService : askQuestion(original, standalone, history)
  ref over QaService
    QA 內部協作見圖6-1-6
  end ref
  alt QA 成功或明確 no-match
    QaService --> ConversationService : answer + citations + runtime
    ConversationService -> MessageModel : create(role=assistant, sources, completed)
  else 系統端失敗
    QaService --> ConversationService : throw 5xx／runtime error
    ConversationService -> QaService : recordFailedAsk()
    ConversationService -> MessageModel : create(role=assistant, status=failed)
  end
  ConversationService -> ConversationModel : 更新 title／updatedAt
  ConversationService --> CoursePage : userMessage + assistantMessage + sources
  CoursePage --> Student : 顯示回答、失敗重試或引用跳轉
end

note over ConversationService,AskLimits
  失敗回答不扣每日次數；retryMessage() 只允許重試具有 failed assistant 的 user message，
  並在重試前重新檢查當日額度與課程權限。
end note

@enduml
